                                    <div class="col-md-12">
                                        		<h2>Our History</h2>
		<p>In the world of Co-operative Banking, Cosmos Co-operative Bank Ltd. holds the record of 120 years of relentless service to its more than 20 lakh satisfied customers through 195 branches in 7 States. Over the past decade, the Bank has made continual progress and has set a model example to co-operative banks by its professional conduct. The bank is committed to maintain the highest level of ethical standards, professional integrity, corporate governance and regulatory compliance. Established with an objective to provide personalized banking services to varied customer base, the bank has served the purpose by understanding the needs of various customers truly and deeply, and designing its products accordingly. Being the member of BCSBI, Bank ensures the highest standards of banking practices to customers.</p>
		<p>The Board of Directors includes eminent and learned personalities from various professions having proficient approach towards formation of policies. The bank is managed by highly qualified, dedicated, dynamic and sincere Management Team.</p>
		<p>Cosmos Bank is not just a Multi-state Scheduled Co-operative Bank but a professionally managed <u>'Financial Institution'</u>.</p>

                                    </div>

