                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   B.E. (CIVIL) & M.E. (STRUCT) FROM COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING, PUNE.</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Mr. Sachin Apte has completed his graduation in Civil Engineering and post-graduation in Structural Engineering from the reputed Govt. College of Engineering Pune.</li>
                                                                    <li>He is a practicing Civil Engineer, working as a promoter and developer since more than 25 years in India as well as abroad. Also, he is a Management Consultant for different firms, hospitals and trusts. He acts as a Facilitator and Liasoning Consultant for reputed hospitals and educational institutes in Pune. He is a successful entrepreneur in hospitality and restaurant industry. He is an active contributor in education field being associated with renowned educational institutes.</li>
                                                                    <li>Along with business interests, Mr. Apte is well connected with many social welfare organizations and working towards betterment of the society.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
