                                                    <div class="bod-point-text">CA Dr. Yashwant Kasar is a Chartered Accountant member of The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) and The Institute of Chartered Accountants in England and Wales (ICAEW-UK), Information Systems Auditor (DISA), Certified Information Sy</div>
