                                                    <div class="bod_head">
                                                        <div class="bod_img">
                                                            <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0608253047_HMBN_Mr. Yeshwant Kasar New addition.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Vice-Chairman CA Dr. Yashwant Kasar">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                            <div class="bod_name">CA Dr. Yashwant Kasar</div>
                                                            <div class="bod_des">Vice-Chairman</div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   Ph.D. (Banking & Finance), FCA (ICAI), ACA (ICAEW-UK), BFP, FAIA, CGEIT, CISA, DISA, PMP</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>CA Dr. Yashwant Kasar is a Chartered Accountant member of The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) and The Institute of Chartered Accountants in England and Wales (ICAEW-UK), Information Systems Auditor (DISA), Certified Information Systems Auditor (CISA), Certified in Governance of Enterprise IT (CGEIT), Project Management Professional (PMP) and Fellow member of the Association of International Accountants, London. Recently he completed his Ph.D. in Banking &amp; Finance from Savitribai Phule Pune University.</li>
                                                                    <li>He is the Regional Council Member of Western India Regional Council (WIRC) of The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India for the term 2019-25. He was Vice Chairman of WIRC of ICAI for the year 2022-23. He also served as Chairman of Pune Branch of WIRC for the year 2015-16. An expert in Tax Laws and Finance, he is a regular writer for the articles in various professional publications and newsletters. He has delivered various lectures on the topics of professional interest at various forums.</li>
                                                                    <li>CA Dr. Yashwant Kasar is the Secretary of CA-COB (Chartered Accountants - Co-Operative Bankers). CA-COB provides a platform to the member Chartered Accountants to share and spread knowledge of changes in banking &amp; deliberate on the challenges faced by UCBs in the best interest of stakeholders.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
