                                                    <div class="sub_title">   M. A., Ph. D Economics</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Dr. Rasika Gupta is a dynamic Economist with expertise in data analytics, business intelligence, statistical modelling and data strategy working at the nexus of business and technology. She has vast experience in economic analysis, policy research and data-driven decision making. She completed her Master&#x2019;s in Economics at Gokhale Institute of Politics and Economics, Pune and Doctor of Philosophy in Economics at the prestigious University of Oklahoma, USA. She received her certification in Leadership and Innovation from Massachusetts Institute of Technology, USA. She has worked with PWC in different roles and capacities like Data Scientist, Business Intelligence and Analytics Manager and Advanced Analytics Lead. She has technical expertise in data visualization, programming, operating systems and much more. Her articles and research papers have been published in various journals and magazines.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
