                                                    <div class="sub_title">   B. Com and M. Com with Distinction, Chartered Accountant</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>CA Surekha Joshi has extensive banking experience of more than 28 years in the co-operative banking sector. She has effectively handled and headed various departments excelling in retail and wholesale loan processing. With proven track record of success in various roles her vast contribution to the SME portfolio is commendable right from grass root level to leadership role. She specializes in Credit Assessment- wholesale &amp;amp; retail. Her attributes include strong analytical and problem-solving skills. She has left her mark with her apt Leadership qualities and comprehensive Team Management. Her achievements have been recognized by various awards and honours. Presently, she is visiting faculty at Deccan Education Society&#x2019;s Pune University (DESPU) teaching subjects like Finance, Costing &amp;amp; Economics. She also provides Financial Consultancy Services.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
