                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Mr. Praveenkumar Gandhi is a Chartered Accountant with over 32 years of rich experience in the General Insurance Industry. He holds a degree in Commerce. He is working as Senior Executive with Insurance Broking firm after retirement. His expertise includes Finance, Treasury Management and Financial Analysis.</li>
                                                                    <li>He has worked as Deputy General Manager in Finance and Investment Department of General Insurance Corporation of India for about 30 years and also worked as Financial Advisor and General Manager. He has worked in Investment Department of GIC Re the only re-insurance company in India. He holds experience in debt / equity / project finance.</li>
                                                            </ul>

