                                                    <div class="sub_title">   B.Sc., FCA</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>CA S. Subramaniam is practicing Chartered Accountancy since last 35 years. He is the senior partner in M/s Sreedhar, Suresh &amp;amp; Rajagopalan LLP, a Chennai based Chartered Accountants firm which was established in the year 1985. Prior to this he was working with a private firm dealing in portfolio of Income Tax matters. At present his expertise lies in the subjects of Direct Taxes, Audit &amp;amp; Assurance and Due Diligence assignments. His firm has been Central Statutory Auditors for renowned public sector banks and public sector companies.</li>
                                                            </ul>

