                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                        <div class="bod_name">Adv. Ghanshyam Amin</div>
                                                        <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="sub_title">Director</div>
                                                <div class="bod_point">
                                                    <div class="bod-point-text">Mr. Ghanshyam Amin is a veteran of Cooperative Sector with experience of more than 40 years.</div>
                                                    <a class="fancybox1 various board-of-directors-read-more-link" style="margin-top:55px;" href="#member_25">Read More</a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="member-detail" id="member_25" style="display: none;">
                                                <div class="bod_box_inner">
                                                    <div class="bod_head">
                                                        <div class="bod_img">
                                                            <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0301252207_HMBN_Adv. Ghanshyam Amin.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Director Adv. Ghanshyam Amin">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                            <div class="bod_name">Adv. Ghanshyam Amin</div>
                                                            <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   B.Sc., LLB</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Mr. Ghanshyam Amin is a veteran of Cooperative Sector with experience of more than 40 years. He has practiced as Senior Advocate in Gujarat High Court. He was also Chairman of Bar Council of Gujarat. He has held many top positions in national and international cooperative sectors such as Vice Chairman of International Cooperative Alliance, Asia Pacific, Geneva, President of National Cooperative Union of India, New Delhi, President of National Council for Cooperative Training, New Delhi, Chairman of Co-operative Bank of India, New Delhi and presently , he is serving as the Vice Chairman of the same. He was also Vice Chairman of National Federation of State Co-operative Bank Association ( NAFSCOB ) Mumbai. He is very active in Gujarat&amp;#39;s cooperative banking sector. He is the Chairman of Gujarat State Cooperative Union, Ahmedabad and Founder Chairman of The Gujarat State Cooperative Credit Societies Federation Ltd, Ahmedabad. He has been the Chairman of Cooperative Bank of Ahmedabad, Ellisbridge Cooperative Bank, The Ahmedabad District Co-operative Bank and Director of The Gujarat State Cooperative Bank Ltd., Ahmedabad. He lead the Board of Management of Cosmos Bank effectively as its Chairman. Additionally, he is active in the field of education and academics. Presently, he is the President of Siddhartha Law College, Gandhinagar &amp;amp; Surat. He was the Ex-Senator of Jawaharlal Nehru University appointed by His Excellency, President of India. He was also Syndicate Member of Gujarat University.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="bod_box" style="padding:50px 5px;">
                                                <div class="bod_head">
                                                    <div class="bod_img">
                                                        <asp:Label ID="lblSCID" runat="server" Text='3' Visible="false"></asp:Label>
                                                        <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0211225534_HMBN_Kokare.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Director Adv. Pralhad Kokare">
