                                                        <div class="bod_name">Adv. Pralhad Kokare</div>
                                                        <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="sub_title">Director</div>
                                                <div class="bod_point">
                                                    <div class="bod-point-text">Adv. Pralhad Kokare is Director of the Bank since 2004. He was Vice Chairman of the Bank in 2019-2020 & 2020-2021. He is an expert in co-operative banking and laws, especially Agri Market Act</div>
                                                    <a class="fancybox1 various board-of-directors-read-more-link" style="margin-top:55px;" href="#member_3">Read More</a>
