                                            </div>
                                            <div class="member-detail" id="member_3" style="display: none;">
                                                <div class="bod_box_inner">
                                                    <div class="bod_head">
                                                        <div class="bod_img">
                                                            <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0211225534_HMBN_Kokare.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Director Adv. Pralhad Kokare">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                            <div class="bod_name">Adv. Pralhad Kokare</div>
                                                            <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   M. SC. (AGRI.), LL.B., GDC & A</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Adv. Pralhad Kokare is Director of the Bank since 2004. He was Vice Chairman of the Bank in 2019-2020 &amp; 2020-2021.  He is an efficient administrator who has been on the Board of Directors of Cosmos Bank for last 20 years. He has retired as Joint-Registrar of Co-operative Societies from the State Government. He is an expert in co-operative banking and laws, especially Agri Market Act.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="bod_box" style="padding:50px 5px;">
                                                <div class="bod_head">
                                                    <div class="bod_img">
                                                        <asp:Label ID="lblSCID" runat="server" Text='13' Visible="false"></asp:Label>
                                                        <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0211220201_HMBN_Tavare.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Director Mr. Arvind Tavare">
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                        <div class="bod_name">Mr. Arvind Tavare</div>
                                                        <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="sub_title">Director</div>
                                                <div class="bod_point">
                                                    <div class="bod-point-text">Mr. Arvind Tavare is an accomplished engineering professional, corporate leader, and technology strategist with extensive global experience spanning civil engineering, project management, and digital governance.</div>
                                                    <a class="fancybox1 various board-of-directors-read-more-link" style="margin-top:55px;" href="#member_13">Read More</a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="member-detail" id="member_13" style="display: none;">
                                                <div class="bod_box_inner">
                                                    <div class="bod_head">
                                                        <div class="bod_img">
                                                            <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0211220201_HMBN_Tavare.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Director Mr. Arvind Tavare">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                            <div class="bod_name">Mr. Arvind Tavare</div>
                                                            <div class="bod_des">Director</div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   D.C.E., M.S. Civil (USA), LEED® G.A. (USA), PJM-I (USA)</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Academic &amp; Research Excellence:  Mr. Tavare holds a postgraduate Master&#x2019;s Degree in Civil Engineering from the United States. During his studies, he was selected as a Research Scholar by the State of Florida and was honored with a State Research Scholarship. A recognized expert in Construction Management, his academic research was published in the European Journal of Engineering. He also presented his groundbreaking research paper at the prestigious &quot;Construction in the 21st Century&quot; conference in Athens, Greece, in 2004.</li>
                                                                    <li>Global Infrastructure &amp; Project Management Experience:  With over eight years of international experience as a Project Principal in the United States, Mr. Tavare has a proven track record of directing iconic, high-profile infrastructure projects, including the Miami Performing Arts Center. A strong advocate for sustainable architecture, he is an accredited professional with the U.S. Green Building Council (USGBC) and holds a coveted LEED&#xAE; license to design and execute high-performance, energy-efficient buildings. His corporate excellence in project delivery was recognized globally in 2010 when he received the prestigious Bank of America Assessment Award for Project Management. He further strengthens his domain expertise with credentials such as a Project Management Foundation Certificate from The University of Texas at Dallas and a Six Sigma White Belt Certification.</li>
                                                                    <li>Corporate Leadership in India:  Upon returning to India, Mr. Tavare assumed the management of a legacy construction corporation based in Pune, alongside leading several other successful business firms.</li>
                                                                    <li>Banking Governance &amp; Technology Leadership:  Mr. Tavare brings deep technological and strategic foresight to banking governance. He served as the Chairman of the Information Technology Committee for Cosmos Co-operative Bank for six years, driving foundational digital initiatives. He currently guides the bank&#x27;s digital transformation roadmap as a senior member of the IT Strategy Committee after having successfully Chaired the IT Strategy committee for 6 long years.. Frequently recognized for his expertise, he is a recurring panelist and Advisory Committee Member for IBEX India (a premier National Technology Conference) and serves on expert panels for various national technology summits across the country.</li>
                                                                    <li>Academic Contributions &amp; Training:  Committed to knowledge sharing, Mr. Tavare is a prominent guest teaching faculty member for elite banking institutions:  RBI&#x2019;s College of Agricultural Banking (CAB): Regularly conducts training sessions on IT Banking and governance frameworks. National Urban Co-operative Finance and Development Corporation (NUCFDC): Conducts extensive training programs covering diverse specialized banking subjects. Bank of India (BOI): Serves as a specialized mentor and faculty member training Top IT Executives.</li>
                                                                    <li>Personal Interests:  Beyond his professional endeavors, Mr. Tavare is a dedicated sports enthusiast with a passionate commitment to Martial Arts and Formula One racing.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
