                                                    <div class="sub_title">   M.E. (Civil), Phd., IIT (Bombay)</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Dr. Balasaheb Sathe has extensive teaching experience of more than 29 years. His passion for teaching took him abroad to Oman where he taught at Shinas College of Technology, Oman. He specializes in the subject of Water Resource Engineering, Quality Survey, Transportation Engineering, Design of Structures to name a few. He has the honour of his research papers being published in both national and international publications. He has delivered lectures, conducted seminars and training programmes on specialized subjects like remote sensing, image processing, GIS, GPS, Arc GroundHydro, Computer tech, Interpersonal Behaviour and many more topics on water resources application. He has examined technical reports concerning projects, floor forecasts etc. He was part of many international conferences.</li>
                                                            </ul>

