                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>Mrs. Anushree Malgaonkar is associated with cooperative sector for more than 25 years. She has worked in Mumbai District Co-op Bank in various roles such as Branch Manager and SRO. She was Director of Maratha Sahakari Bank for 16 years and Chairman of the Bank for 8 years.&#xA0;She was Director of Mumbai District Co-op Housing Society Federation for 5 years and also Editor of Housing Times published by federation.&#xA0;She is now Director of Mumbai District Nagrik Sahakari Bank Association. She is dedicated to social causes through Sawantwadi Sansthan Maratha Samaj Mumbai as Joint Secretary.</li>
