                                                <div class="sub_title">Managing Director</div>
                                                <div class="bod_point">
                                                    <div class="bod-point-text">With over 40+ years of experience in the banking industry, Mrs. Apekshita Thipsay is a highly respected and accomplished senior banker. She has a proven track record of success in credit management, finance, administration and corporate governance</div>
                                                    <a class="fancybox1 various board-of-directors-read-more-link" style="margin-top:55px;" href="#member_16">Read More</a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="member-detail" id="member_16" style="display: none;">
                                                <div class="bod_box_inner">
                                                    <div class="bod_head">
                                                        <div class="bod_img">
                                                            <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/0211220355_HMBN_Thipsay.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Managing Director Mrs. Apekshita Thipsay">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                            <div class="bod_name">Mrs. Apekshita Thipsay</div>
                                                            <div class="bod_des">Managing Director</div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="sub_title">   M.com, LLB, CAIIB</div>
                                                    <div class="bod_point">

                                                            <ul>
                                                                    <li>With over 40&#x2B; years of experience in the banking industry, Mrs. Apekshita Thipsay is a highly respected and accomplished senior banker. She has a proven track record of success in credit management, finance, administration and corporate governance with strong focus on driving business growth, improving operational efficiency and fostering a culture of innovation and customer centricity.</li>
                                                                    <li>Throughout her career, she held various leadership positions. She joined Cosmos Bank in 1983, held various responsibilities and rose up to the level of Managing Director of the Bank.</li>
                                                                    <li>Under her leadership, the Bank has achieved significant milestones viz. achieving business mix of Rs.35000 crore, historic net profit of Rs.384 crore, amalgamation of 4 co-operative banks and branch expansion across various regions.</li>
                                                                    <li>As a forward-thinking and result oriented leader, she demonstrates the ability to lead the organization and pass on the value to stakeholders. She has been instrumental in implementing various initiatives which include increasing the brand value of the Bank, quality management, creating a culture of ethics and excellence.</li>
                                                                    <li>She has been honored with numerous awards like &#x2018;Young Achievers Award&#x2019; for her contribution to banking sector in the National Conference of Indian Women&#x2019;s Council, Banking Business Leadership Award- CEO in Top 100 CXO Summit and ICONIC Leaders Award 2024 organized by NAFCUB and NCUI.</li>
                                                                    <li>She has conducted several training sessions for bankers and also authored many books related to banking sector.</li>
                                                                    <li>Mrs. Apekshita Thipsay is a member of Managing Committee of Indian Bank&#x2019;s Association (IBA). Utilizing this forum, she is representing views and concerns of the UCB sector in order to strengthen the co-operative movement.</li>
                                                            </ul>

                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                    </div>
