                                        <div class="member-detail" id="member_100" style="display: none;">
                                            <div class="bod_box_inner">
                                                <div class="bod_head">
                                                    <div class="bod_img">
                                                        <img src="/auth/writereaddata/images/BOM_CA_MILIND_KALE.png" class="img-responsive">
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="bod_name_des_det">
                                                        <div class="bod_name">CA MILIND KALE</div>
                                                        <div class="bod_des">B.COM (HON.), F.C.A, GRAD. C.W.A, MBA (FINANCE), DIPLOMA IN JOURNALISM</div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="bod_point" style="margin-top: 40px;">

                                                    <ul>
                                                        <li>
                                                            <p>
                                                                CA Milind Kale completed his schooling at the renowned school Jnana Prabodhini and college
                                                                education at Ness Wadia College.
                                                                Under absolute adverse conditions he completed 5 professional courses viz., Chartered
                                                                Accountancy, Cost Accountancy, Business Administration, MBA Finance and Journalism within a
                                                                very short time-span displaying his extraordinary intellect.
                                                                He started his own Chartered Accountancy practice in 1983. He has taken forward the legacy of
                                                                three generation of entrepreneurship. Kale family was into numerous businesses at that time.
                                                                Through those businesses he got opportunity to work extensively in the field of Finance. The main
                                                                reason for this was his educational qualifications and expertise in the field of Finance and Economy.
                                                                Thus, was is on the Board of Directors of Cosmos Bank for 25 long years since 1999 and Chairman
                                                                from 2015 to 2024.
                                                            </p> <p>
                                                                Apart from Cooperative Sector, his contribution in the field of education, social work, journalism is
                                                                well-recognized. He has given impetus to and encouraged Marathi /Maharashtrian Youth to start
                                                                business through various annual conclaves. He has supported them by economically assisting them
                                                                through the Bank. He has a special place as Orator in various seminars on Finance and Economy.
                                                                Kale has also chaired SPPU’s Board of Examiners for Business Management Diploma.
                                                                To give impetus to women to take on entrepreneurship, he introduced loan scheme especially for
                                                                women through Cosmos Bank. Women are offered loan at reduced rate of interest through this loan
                                                                scheme. Under his able leadership Cosmos Bank has funded more than 1500 Self Help Groups to
                                                                start their home-based business, thus empowering them financially. This has helped more than
                                                                15000 women to be financial independent. With his active participation, this mission of women
                                                                empowerment is doing very well.
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p>
                                                                Since last couple of decades, cooperative banks’ image has plummeted due to misappropriation by
                                                                few banks. To enhance and uplift the image of cooperative banks Chartered Accountants in
                                                                Cooperative Banks (CACOB) organization is working dedicatedly. Kale is the Vice-Chairman of
                                                                CACOB, thus adding CACOB with his expertise in cooperative banking sector. He has also been
                                                                appointed as Co-opted Member of the Director Board of The Maharashtra Urban Cooperative Banks’
                                                                Federation.
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p>
                                                                He is also elected as the Vice-chairman of Cooperative Bank of India (COBI), New Delhi. Milind Kale
                                                                is well-known for his transparent values, work ethics, positive yet realistic attitude, futuristic vision,
                                                                ability to face all challenges resolutely and much more. CA Kale is the elected as Vice President of
                                                                National Federation of Urban Co-operative Banks &amp; Credit Societies (NAFCUB), New Delhi for the
                                                                period of 5 years i.e. from year 2024 to 2029.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </li>
                                                    </ul>

